        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896110/extras/56f99f9a2d69099b172ba936e5153a74.poster.avif?t=1763336838\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896110/extras/56f99f9a2d69099b172ba936e5153a74.webm?t=1763336838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896110/extras/56f99f9a2d69099b172ba936e5153a74.mp4?t=1763336838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One rainy day, a lonely life enters your ordinary routine. A small cat abandoned in the rain. Unable to turn away from its pitiful eyes, you decide to bring the creature home. Now, this small life begins a new journey under your care. But a cat is not just a simple being. As you are responsible for a precious life, you can't just give it anything. You must choose the best for your cat, care for it devotedly, and build a bond. How will the cat grow with your love and care? And what will be the final moments of this small, precious life?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a bond with your cat</strong> Provide a suitable environment for your cat, and through careful observation, meet its needs to deepen your bond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose what to feed your cat</strong> You must select the most suitable food for your cat from various types. Each food will have a different impact on your cat's health and mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try different foods</strong> Beyond simply filling its belly, find the optimal diet by considering your cat's health and preferences. Your careful attention will enrich your cat's life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe your cat's final moments</strong> Watch your cat grow and change under your care. And you will experience the final moments of your journey with this precious companion. What will your cat's final moments truly look like?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896110/extras/65df082709e24b14da65dfdd1d40cf9f.poster.avif?t=1763336838\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896110/extras/65df082709e24b14da65dfdd1d40cf9f.webm?t=1763336838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896110/extras/65df082709e24b14da65dfdd1d40cf9f.mp4?t=1763336838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay sessions last approximately 5-20 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing time with cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected emotions you haven't experienced before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats that can change even without being fed.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896110/extras/56f99f9a2d69099b172ba936e5153a74.poster.avif?t=1763336838\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896110/extras/56f99f9a2d69099b172ba936e5153a74.webm?t=1763336838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896110/extras/56f99f9a2d69099b172ba936e5153a74.mp4?t=1763336838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One rainy day, a lonely life enters your ordinary routine. A small cat abandoned in the rain. Unable to turn away from its pitiful eyes, you decide to bring the creature home. Now, this small life begins a new journey under your care. But a cat is not just a simple being. As you are responsible for a precious life, you can't just give it anything. You must choose the best for your cat, care for it devotedly, and build a bond. How will the cat grow with your love and care? And what will be the final moments of this small, precious life?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a bond with your cat</strong> Provide a suitable environment for your cat, and through careful observation, meet its needs to deepen your bond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose what to feed your cat</strong> You must select the most suitable food for your cat from various types. Each food will have a different impact on your cat's health and mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try different foods</strong> Beyond simply filling its belly, find the optimal diet by considering your cat's health and preferences. Your careful attention will enrich your cat's life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe your cat's final moments</strong> Watch your cat grow and change under your care. And you will experience the final moments of your journey with this precious companion. What will your cat's final moments truly look like?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896110/extras/65df082709e24b14da65dfdd1d40cf9f.poster.avif?t=1763336838\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896110/extras/65df082709e24b14da65dfdd1d40cf9f.webm?t=1763336838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896110/extras/65df082709e24b14da65dfdd1d40cf9f.mp4?t=1763336838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay sessions last approximately 5-20 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing time with cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected emotions you haven't experienced before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats that can change even without being fed.</p></li></ul>",
